[options="header",cols="10%,10%,10%,70%"]
|======

| Property
| Mandatory 
| Type
| Description


| allow
| no
| array
| List of allowed JSON schemas, the data of this field must match.

| elasticsearch
| no
| object
| Additional elasticsearch index field configuration. This can be used to add custom fields with custom analyzers to the search index.

| label
| no
| string
| Label of the field.

| name
| yes
| string
| Name of the field.

| noIndex
| no
| boolean
| Flag which indicates whether the field is excluded from indexing or not.

| required
| no
| boolean
| Flag which indicates whether the field is required or not. A create request will fail if no field value has been specified. The update request will fail when the value is omitted and the field has never been saved before.

| type
| yes
| string
| Type of the field.

|======
